一碗吃完，有飽足感。食量大的人，可以要求續一次麵，湯就沒有提供再續。\n\n用餐需先入內以機器點餐，結完帳後到門外候位，依照燈號順序，一組人都到齊才能入座，若過號需要再等二組。",null,[0,77]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2270775935772479147/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRrYlZsdVJUQlNNMmhQWVVSb2RtSXpVakZZTTJScldXdFNObE13UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2270775935772479147/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRrYlZsdVJUQlNNMmhQWVVSb2RtSXpVakZZTTJScldXdFNObE13UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2270775935772479147/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRrYlZsdVJUQlNNMmhQWVVSb2RtSXpVakZZTTJScldXdFNObE13UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2270775935772479147/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRrYlZsdVJUQlNNMmhQWVVSb2RtSXpVakZZTTJScldXdFNObE13UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2270775935772479147/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRrYlZsdVJUQlNNMmhQWVVSb2RtSXpVakZZTTJScldXdFNObE13UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2270775935772479147/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRrYlZsdVJUQlNNMmhQWVVSb2RtSXpVakZZTTJScldXdFNObE13UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,7028,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkbVluRTBSM2hPYURodmIzUjFYM2RrWWtSNlMwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xc4a0d5867b1f554!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkdmYnE0R3hOaDhvb3R1X3dkYkR6S0E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkbVluRTBSM2hPYURodmIzUjFYM2RrWWtSNlMwRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkbVluRTBSM2hPYURodmIzUjFYM2RrWWtSNlMwRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkbVluRTBSM2hPYURodmIzUjFYM2RrWWtSNlMwRRILMGRNeFdOWmVoV0UaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rZG1ZbkUwUjNoT2FEaHZiM1IxWDNka1lrUjZTMEUSCzBkTXhXTlplaFdFIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARVPWxZ1gNSgwqCzBkTXhXTlplaFdF\u0026wv\u003d1\u0